;+ Added COMPS < > on the head-dtr, to avoid spurious parses on non intransitive verbs ("aiph hild akl lxm")
;+ Added C-CONT.RELS <! !>, in order to get an mrs with all the relations in "ph dnh nplh atmwl".
;NURIT-TEMPORARILY COMMENTED OUT
